  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Qt: Dynamically allocate IO Graph items with a higher limit",
  "description": "The GTK implementation made the number of IO graph items\nunlimited (524583298beb671f43e972476693866754d38a38 and followups),\nbut let's start with just increasing the maximum number by a\nfactor of roughly 67. If we need even more we can do that later.\n\nMake it a std::vector, since we're using C++. Pointers to elements\nare guaranteed to work just like arrays when interfacing with C.\n\nFix #8460",
